  "description": "A younger brother who is a student at Seoul National University and an older brother who is a repeat student. The two identical twin brothers are so different. Jun-Seo, who has been compared to his younger brother Jun-Su his whole life, ends up wearing his younger brother's pajamas at his mother's suggestion, and thus begins his precarious campus life.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
